class WorldFx:
    """In-world renderer for the tower-engine entities that are not plain sprites: TrackZones (paint, loop,
tornado, vortex, outpaint, tempest), TrackWalkers (DALL-E creatures, Llama charges and the stampede herd),
Drones (companions, study buddies, Qwen patrol drones, MiniMax clones), NodeHazards (GLM nodes,
laser links, slow grid), GPT's orbiting moons and Astra Beam, the Copilot strike drone and Gemini's singularity.

Style matches the sprite package: thick dark outline, saturated fills, a white gloss highlight. It is
immediate mode: two lightweight GObjects (#ground() under the enemies, #top() above
them) paint the live lists of game.getEffects() straight into the graphics context with a handful of
reusable shapes, so there is no scene-graph churn at all and nothing to remove when an entity expires. The only
state kept is the first-seen time of each entity (for pop-in animations), pruned a few times a second.

Level of detail (#setLod): 0 = full, 1 = no small decorations, 2 = flat silhouettes only. At most
#MAX_DRAWN entities of each kind are drawn."""
    class Sing:
        """A live Gemini singularity: centre, radius, start time (fx clock) and hold time."""
        def __init__(self):
            self.at = None
            self.radius = 0.0
            self.t0 = 0.0
            self.hold = 0.0
            self.rgb = 0
